value setup through: cooperating beats defecting once q exceeds 5/7, and since the twins share a deliberation, I'd put that correlation high, around 0.9, which clears the threshold, so passing comes out ahead.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm working through the EDT version of the twin prisoner's dilemma from the essay, where both twins share the same deliberation, so my choice is evidence about the other's. Comparing the expected cost in years of passing against submitting, I'm setting up the two expected-value expressions to see when cooperating comes out ahead.\n\nI'm carrying the expected-value setup through: cooperating beats defecting once q exceeds 5/7, and since the twins share a deliberation, I'd put that correlation high, around 0.9, which clears the threshold, so passing comes out ahead.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":8770,"completion_tokens":779,"total_tokens":9549,"cost":0.05066,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.05066,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.03508,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.01558},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":312,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}